</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Utility decrement for toxicity states</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Hair loss (grade I/II)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.03 (0.01)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.03 (0.01)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.03 (0.01)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Skin reaction (grade I/II)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.06 (0.01)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.08 (0.01)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.03 (0.01)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Diarrhoea (grade I/II)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.09 (0.01)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.11 (0.01)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.06 (0.01)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Nausea/vomiting (grade I/II)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.10 (0.01)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.12 (0.01)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.07 (0.01)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Flu-like syndrome (grade I/II)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.11 (0.01)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.13 (0.01)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.09 (0.01)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Stomatitis (grade I/II)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="("